comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T14:47:23.133Z",codex-sol,"Required checks verified: verify (22), verify (26), analyze. CodeQL remains unfiltered. Inspecting docs inputs, deterministic property depth and harness deadlines; release caller and verifiers remain outside scope."
  "2026-11-15T14:50:02.211Z",codex-sol,"Baseline main run 43679416505: verify (26) 15m05s including queue, 7m execution; verify (22) 22m21s including queue, 3m52s execution. Job-log API recovered durations after the run-log command returned empty. Topology and metadata property cases took 5.95s and 5.45s. Cheap tier retains identity, README/license/workflow contracts and package file allowlist. Packed acceptance proves Bun and bun x installs. Full local depth intentionally not run."
  "2026-11-15T14:50:49.234Z",codex-sol,"Validation: typecheck passed (2.5s), lint passed (5s), seven touched suites passed at quick depth and scale 3 (82.7s), helper contract test passed (0.9s); strict unique-key YAML parse passed (actionlint unavailable). Original full npm release gates measured 3m14s on Node 26 and 3m37s on Node 22 in hosted CI. One quick coverage run is in progress with unchanged 100 percent thresholds."
  "2026-11-15T14:51:48.063Z",codex-sol,PR #51 opened. Required CI and CodeQL jobs are queued; no completed PR wall-time measurement yet. Changelog consistency required one generated entry for the new in-progress task; updating it in the follow-up commit. No review threads were changed.
  "2026-11-15T14:52:31.039Z",codex-sol,"Quick coverage passed: 141 tests, 115.45s test phase, unchanged 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines. No late-seed coverage patch needed. Local strict health reports a global extension warning; tracker integrity and history checks pass. Hosted CI has no global extension configuration. Required PR checks remain queued at handoff."
  "2026-11-16T08:24:23.970Z",codex-sol,"Batch 2 template follow-up: split deep validation into Node 22/26 x npm/Bun with one conditional full release gate per job; preserve runner selection and full depth/time scale; disable deep cancellation; extend executable tracker/docs routing. Required CodeQL check remains unfiltered. Existing hosted-only npm cache restoration and Bun installation plus version logging already conform. Release callers, sync workflows, verifier scripts, protection and variables stay unchanged."
  "2026-11-16T08:29:00.053Z",codex-sol,"Latest successful PR run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brand/actions/runs/43726735608: Node 22/26 execution 40s/3m24s; created-to-completed including queue 109m48s/105m57s. Both executions fit the approximately 15-minute target, so item 6 needs no quick-depth or sharding change. Items 1, 2 and 5 changed; item 3 exempt because CodeQL is required; item 4 already conforms. Added strict unique-key YAML, one-gate matrix, runner setup and executable-path behavioral contracts."
  "2026-11-16T08:29:23.884Z",codex-sol,"Final local proof passed through pm test --run --only-last --progress: strict unique-key YAML parsing of every workflow, workflow contracts, npm run typecheck and npm run lint. actionlint is unavailable. Initial helper annotation/build setup issues were corrected before the passing rerun. No full-depth run attempted locally; deep certification remains after merge. PR observation is bounded to 30 minutes after the final push."
